# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 0580:043A"
msgid "...And for treasonous plots against the fair Lady Mordea... "
msgstr "……以及密謀叛逆，危害美麗的莫爾迪亞夫人……"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 0580:0491"
msgid "...And for treasonous plots against the fair Lady Mordea... "
msgstr "……以及密謀叛逆，危害美麗的莫爾迪亞夫人……"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 0580:04F5"
msgid "Hail, Lady Mordea! "
msgstr "參見莫爾迪亞夫人！"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 0580:05C8"
msgid "We bring you a thief! "
msgstr "我們帶來一個小偷！"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 0580:06A4"
msgid "Watch it! "
msgstr "小心點！"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 0580:0753"
msgid "We caught him breaking into the evidence chamber! "
msgstr "我們抓到他闖進證物室！"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 0580:0776"
msgid "Well done! "
msgstr "做得好！"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 0580:07B6"
msgid "The block always welcomes another neck. "
msgstr "斬首木墩永遠歡迎多一個脖子。"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 0580:07F5"
msgid "I am sorry to see you here, my friend. "
msgstr "很遺憾在這裡見到你，朋友。"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 0580:083F"
msgid "It appears we will both become victims of Mordea. "
msgstr "看來我們都要成為莫爾迪亞的犧牲品了。"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 0580:085E"
msgid "Please... "
msgstr "拜託……"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 0580:0993"
msgid "Yes, yes, we must attend to Devon's beheading first! "
msgstr "好，好，我們得先處理戴文的斬首！"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 0580:0A5E"
msgid "Goodbye, my friend. "
msgstr "再見，朋友。"

# P13 batch 6
msgctxt "bark 0580:0A96"
msgid "May Lithos forgive our spirits. "
msgstr "願利索斯寬恕我們的靈魂。"
